			"notes": "### Technical API changes\nTo tackle issues like https://github.com/TheCSDev/betterstats/issues/65, it has been made possible to instantiate `TScreenWrapper<T>` instances directly.\n\nThis resulted in a structural change where `TScreen#createWrapperScreen()` is not called immediately upon instantiation of a `TScreen`. Instead, a `TScreen` will receive its corresponding wrapper instance when either:\n- `TScreen#getAsScreen()` is called, or\n- A `TScreenWrapper<T>` instance is manually instantiated for said `TScreen` (ex. `new TScreenWrapper<>(myTScreen)`).\n\nTherefore, `TScreen#getAsScreen()` is no longer \"pure\". If you happen to be a developer using this API, you should keep this in mind."
		},
