			"notes": "- Resolves incompatibility with game's \"Improved transparency\" video setting. See \"Better Statistics Screen\"'s [Issue #62](https://github.com/TheCSDev/betterstats/issues/62) for more info. Thank you [ShuAIMouse](https://github.com/ShuAIMouse) for reporting the issue.\n    - **Technical explanation:** Added new rendering-related `Mixin` that now removes water-mask submissions before picture-in-picture rendering so \"Improved transparency\" does not crash on GUI render passes."
		},
