			"notes": "(Incomplete) port to Minecraft `26.3`.\n\n**Note on this beta release:**  \nIn `26.3`, Minecraft migrated from [GLFW](https://www.glfw.org/) to [SDL](https://www.libsdl.org/). Consequently, the game's input handling has changed.\n\nAs side-effect; while this mod has mostly adapted, I have not managed fully to port it properly in a timely manner (instead opting for a \"band aid\" solution). Expect text input fields and any typing-related GUI (from my mods) to be buggy. In addition, such GUI (from my mods) can only handle English keyboard layouts for now. Apologies in advance for the inconvenience."
		},
